@walvka-code/proj-doc-builder README · Load: give a fresh conversation an entry point (overview → one document)：The stance, in one sentence: **"docs are in sync" must be backed by a manifest the tooling wrote,
not by the model that produced the prose.**

---

@walvka-code/proj-doc-builder README · Tests：**360 tests** (Windows: 354 passed / 6 skipped; on Linux only the Windows-handle-semantics tests
flip to skipped). Everything runs in `tmp_path` — your real `project_docs/` is never touched. They
pin **crash consistency**, not features:

@walvka-code/proj-doc-builder README · 工作流六阶段：**协调器不生成任何自然语言**：它只做校验与事务发布，正文由生成方（人或模型）写入。

退出码：`0` 全过 / `1` 闸门失败（含"存在待恢复事务"）/ `2` 输入或运行错误 / `3` 发布失败（**不等于未发布**，以 `publish.disposition` 为准）。

